    ("Arberth and Gorsedd Arberth", "Arberth a Gorsedd Arberth", 51.799, -4.743, "Narberth in Pembrokeshire, Pwyll’s chief court. The mound of wonders stood near by; some place it on Narberth’s castle hill, others at Camp Hill outside the town.", "Tref Arberth yn Sir Benfro, prif lys Pwyll. Safai twmpath y rhyfeddodau gerllaw; mae rhai’n ei osod ar fryn castell Arberth, eraill y tu allan i’r dref.", ""),
