    ("Gwent Is Coed", "Gwent Is Coed", 51.61, -2.77, "Gwent below the wood, between the Usk and the Wye, where Teyrnon found the child by his stable door. Caerwent was its old capital.", "Gwent islaw’r coed, rhwng Wysg a Gwy, lle cafodd Teyrnon y plentyn wrth ddrws ei stabl. Caer-went oedd ei hen brifddinas.", "place-caerwent.html"),
